 "description": {
  "content": "Get Spam-Free Insurance Advice by Ditto👇\nhttps://ditto.sh/a2xs5h\n\nLooking for good stocks to buy today? In this video, we break down four powerful, beginner-friendly stock picking strategies to help you find high-quality companies and build a strong investment portfolio. Instead of relying on random tips, you will learn a systematic way to analyze the stock market using data-driven tools like Finology Ticker.\n\nWe start by looking at a major trap most retail investors fall into when hunting for 52-week low stocks, and explain why a cheap price doesn't always mean a cheap valuation. From there, we dive into comparing companies with their industry peers, uncovering the hidden stock market giants behind the household brands you consume every single day, and utilizing licensed SEBI-registered experts to validate your research.\n\nWatch the full video to master these frameworks and completely change how you filter, analyze, and select your next investment. Remember to like, subscribe, and drop your questions in the comments below!\n____________________________________________________________________________________\n00:00 - Introduction\n00:50 - How to Find 52-Week Low Stocks\n03:13 - Analyzing Super Investors' Portfolios\n06:36 - Protecting Your Wealth \n07:31 - Step-by-Step Stock Screening Framework\n09:41 - How to Compare Industry Competitors\n11:20 - \"Invest in What You Consume\" Strategy\n13:37 - Consulting SEBI-Registered Financial Experts\n14:56 - What to Avoid\n16:54 - Conclusion \n______________________________________________________________________________________\n\n➡️ Get 30 Stocks For Long Term: https://tinyurl.com/30stocks\n\n➡️ The Modern Stock Screener: https://tinyurl.com/Finology-Ticker\n\n➡️ Join my WhatsApp channel: https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029Va8O...\n\n➡️ Open Zerodha Demat Account for FREE - https://zerodha.com/open-account?c=ZM...\n\n➡️ Buy Investonomy: https://amzn.to/4jkeM09\n_____________________________________________